<title>USA: LG&amp;E Energy names Victor Staffieri CFO.</title>
<headline>LG&amp;E Energy names Victor Staffieri CFO.</headline>
<dateline>LOUSVILLE, Ky. 1997-04-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>LG&amp;E Energy Corp said Thursday it had oted Victor Staffieri to the post of chief financial al officer.</p>
<p>Staffieri replaces Walter Berger, who was named group president-energy marketing.</p>
<p>Staffieri previously was president of distribution services and Louisville Gas and Electric Co. His former titles will be assumed by Stephen Wood.</p>
